{"type":"text","timestamp":1794544838269,"sessionID":"ses_e2ccd293affe14TOdLD5l4JKj6","part":{"id":"prt_1d33517be002q0JvIm6UV7K5JK","sessionID":"ses_e2ccd293affe14TOdLD5l4JKj6","messageID":"msg_1d3350d2b001zi4B4dABIDz1ww","type":"text","text":"T016 complete. Both files named by the task are written, and both verify gates pass.\n\n**Files written**\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/advisor-recommend.ts`\n  - added `routeNeedsMode` to the `../lib/command-attach.js` import\n  - in `enrichCompiledRoutes`, the else branch is now `: { ...recommendation, compiledRoute, ...(!command && routeNeedsMode(recommendation.skillId, compiledRoute) ? { needsMode: true as const } : {}) };`\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-recommend-compiled-route-option.vitest.ts`\n  - added `needsMode?: boolean` to the `ResponsePayload` recommendation type\n  - added one case: a `defer` route marks the `sk-doc` row `needsMode: true` with no `command` for `Write a README for the ledger module`, and a `defer` for `sk-code` leaves no `needsMode` key for `Implement a TypeScript feature with focused tests for the ledger.` (both prompts unused elsewhere in the file, so the prompt cache cannot answer)\n\n**Verify output**\n\n`npx vitest run tests/handlers/advisor-recommend-compiled-route-option.vitest.ts` in `ADV`:\n\n```\n RUN  v4.1.12 /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  6 passed (6)\n   Start at  05:40:29\n   Duration  535ms (transform 197ms, setup 13ms, import 277ms, tests 184ms, environment 0ms)\nVARC_EXIT:0\n```\n\n`npm run typecheck` in `ADV`:\n\n```\n> typecheck\n> ../../system-spec-kit/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --composite false -p tsconfig.build.json\n\nTYPECHECK_EXIT:0\n```\n\n**Notes**\n\n- `routeNeedsMode` was already exported by `command-attach.ts` when I started, so the import resolved without touching that file.\n- I did not tick the T016 checkbox in `tasks.md`, and touched no other file.\n- Nothing was left undone.","time":{"start":1794544834494,"end":1794544838269}}}
